Here's a nifty sequence for Nikita Klepov to end the period.

First, the backhand outlet off the boards to Cutter Gauthier, and then in the zone, he finds space, curls and squeezes a pass through to Leo Carlsson. Skills are evident.

@SportingTrib | #FlyTogether

That $18 million man is here folks. Leo Carlsson absolutely dangles San Jose 4th line center Samuel Huo out of his skates and pops it top corner.

Klepov and Helleson pick up assists, but wow.

@SportingTrib | #FlyTogether

Jackson LaCombe evens it up on the rush for the Ducks.

Great breakout from Tristan Luneau. Cutter Gauthier fights through to get into the zone and spy LaCombe. Nikita Klepov driving the center lane as well.

